# Pairs with GateOwnership. The move-away marker is written only under C's split gate.
MODULE: ConsolidationSkipsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the admitted consolidation turn proceeds as if it held C's split gate
PERTURBS: AdmitConsolidation

--- FIND
    /\ Admits("C", FALSE)
    /\ cons' = "running"
--- REPLACE
    /\ Admits("C", FALSE)
    \* MUTATION: the gate is skipped
    /\ cons' = "holding"
--- END
